    tips: ['`__dirname` holds the folder the current .js file lives in. `require(\'path\').join(__dirname, \'data.json\')` finds the file no matter where you run the script from.', 'Put all your requires at the very top of the file, so anyone reading it sees what it depends on.', 'In this game the code runs in a sandbox with pretend files, so you can\'t damage anything real.'],
