    tips: ['While you\'re learning, read the file back after writing it to check what it holds.', 'End each line you write with `\\n`, so the file plays nicely with `cat`, `tail` and Git.', 'Commit your project to Git before running code that rewrites files. If it goes wrong, you can get the old version back.'],
